00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:41.000
The one you like, miss.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.250
Let's go, maestro. One, two.

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:57.650
It's not normal, you see?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:04.290
