00:26:19.440 --> 00:26:21.440
Oh, she's a slut.

00:26:21.440 --> 00:26:24.240
Besides, she's a great artist.

00:26:24.240 --> 00:26:25.160
We'll see.

00:26:25.160 --> 00:26:30.000
I've sent her some messages.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:35.950
You already understand me, how a poor girl will be dazzled.

00:26:35.950 --> 00:26:50.710
But I understand that, all the great artists have their admirers, but if we have not debuted yet, imagine when we debut, they will fill us with applause, go ahead.

00:26:50.710 --> 00:26:59.090
To the Miss Elvira del Solal.

00:27:43.530 --> 00:27:46.420
Come on, everyone get ready, let's go to El Telón.

00:28:54.060 --> 00:28:57.620
It's late. Don't worry, you'll pay the fine.

00:28:57.930 --> 00:28:59.000
What did you say?

00:29:00.030 --> 00:29:01.510
