00:29:01.850 --> 00:29:03.140
I don't know what to do.

00:29:03.300 --> 00:29:04.380
Ten pesos for two.

00:29:07.840 --> 00:29:09.740
What a shame, huh?

00:29:12.960 --> 00:29:25.650
They took the river, right?

00:29:26.120 --> 00:29:29.380
If you were a man, you'd go to the cemetery with me.

00:29:30.030 --> 00:29:35.630
