00:29:36.040 --> 00:29:37.000
- Miss Nari? - Yes.

00:30:04.320 --> 00:30:07.480
- Do you see? - Look at what I've just done.

00:30:07.990 --> 00:30:09.860
Everything is for art.

00:30:10.640 --> 00:30:13.000
You'll see what goddesses they are.

00:30:13.120 --> 00:30:18.990
Don't worry. We'll both succeed.

00:30:24.560 --> 00:30:30.000
Come on, love.

00:30:30.030 --> 00:30:41.910
I'm happy with the impudence, of blow, dry and straight.

00:30:41.910 --> 00:30:49.030
To the one you love, a "no"; to the one you love, a "no".

00:30:49.030 --> 00:30:51.910
In one, more than rival.

00:30:51.910 --> 00:30:55.310
Woman, I'm brave, more than volatil.

00:30:55.310 --> 00:31:00.000
Losing, I can pretend to shine.

00:31:00.060 --> 00:31:03.440
Flood, nobody can beat

00:31:04.100 --> 00:31:07.360
this champion you can call yourself.

00:31:08.630 --> 00:31:11.170
Your blow is straight like the fire and you get out of breath,

00:31:11.170 --> 00:31:13.510
you get punished, you get betrayed,

00:31:13.510 --> 00:31:16.510
