00:32:38.680 --> 00:32:39.860
To your post.

00:33:02.520 --> 00:33:03.040
That's it.

00:34:05.720 --> 00:34:08.420
- Hey, how are you doing? - Well, man.

00:34:30.060 --> 00:34:32.060
I've already copied the number!

00:34:32.060 --> 00:34:34.060
20 pesos.

00:34:34.060 --> 00:34:38.060
